  - prove the 7 environment-attributed failures by comparing against the upstream base;
  - production pnpm build;
  - add cc-sync's new 'restricted-mid-transfer' pause reason (schema, label, 6 locales via codex, tests);
  - code review, then a PR body delta.
- **Visual proof:** screenshots are generated locally by tests/tools/cross-machine-recovery-rendered/run.mjs. Attaching them to the PR remains a user gate because the proof-branch push was classifier-denied.
